<rml>
<head>
    <title>Write Letter</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="letter_write.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/template" href="window_shell.rml"/>
</head>
<!-- The whole window is drawn here, in the main context, like every other window of this family.
     The panel paints its full width: the portrait composites after this context, through the seam
     MuRenderer::SetPostRmlUiCallback opens (UI::RmlBridge::OverlayRender), so it stands on the
     panel rather than under it and needs no opening cut for it.

     That seam is above the whole context, not at this window's own depth, so only the window in
     front draws its character -- CUIWindowMgr::RenderOverlay3D() picks it. Behind, #photo_slot
     shows its empty well until the window is brought forward again.

     #photo_slot reserves and paints the well: RCSS decides where the portrait sits and C++ tells
     the native CUIPhotoViewer to follow that box. It also carries the viewer's input, since a
     press over a document never reaches the legacy mouse globals -- see PhotoViewerControl.h.
     #photo_help is the hit area for the "?" the viewer itself draws. #frame_fill is the panel's own
     fill; each theme decides whether it needs it. #drag_strip is the title strip, since
     window_shell's rail is the banner art's full height and reaches over the content.

     Handlers are data-event-*, never on*: on* is RmlUi's inline script event and this build has no
     script interpreter, so those bind to nothing at all and fail silently. -->
<body template="window_shell" data-model="letter_write">
    <div id="frame_fill"></div>
    <div id="drag_strip"></div>
    <div id="window_controls">
        <button id="btn_minimize" data-event-click="letter_action('minimize')"></button>
        <button id="btn_close_x" data-event-click="letter_action('close')"></button>
    </div>
    <div id="rows">
        <div class="row"><span class="label">{{receiver_label}}</span><input id="mailto_field" type="text" class="text-field" data-value="mailto" maxlength="10"/></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="label">{{subject_label}}</span><input id="subject_field" type="text" class="text-field" data-value="subject" maxlength="60"/></div>
    </div>
    <div id="body_wrap"><textarea id="body_field" class="text-field" data-value="body"></textarea></div>
    <div id="photo_slot"><div id="photo_help"></div></div>
    <div id="footer">
        <button class="btn" data-class-disabled="sending" data-event-click="letter_action('send')">{{send_label}}</button><button class="btn" data-event-click="letter_action('close')">{{close_label}}</button><button class="btn pose" data-event-click="letter_action('prev_pose')">{{prev_pose_label}}</button><button class="btn pose" data-event-click="letter_action('next_pose')">{{next_pose_label}}</button>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
